{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And this day shall be.</b> It shall be a remembrance for generations." "<b>And you shall celebrate it.</b> It is the festival of Passover. And it says \"a statute forever for your generations,\" but does not say \"in all your settlements,\" for this commandment depends on the Land, as I shall explain."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:33.074608769Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}